# Jow OS v6

    An independent 64-bit operating system written from scratch in
    freestanding C and NASM assembly.

    Shipped with **JowVM**—my custom standalone `/dev/kvm` hypervisor
    modeled on real bare-metal PC hardware (Intel Core i5-4590 / Q87M-E) with
    dirty-RAM poisoning, 1080p SDL2 display, and xHCI USB 3.0 stack.

    ## Downloads & Pre-Releases

    Pre-compiled binary packages and bootable ISOs are available under
    [Releases](https://github.com/jowettarchie3/jowOS_v6/releases):
    - **`jow-os-v6-jowvm-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`**: Standalone portable bundle.
    Run `./run-jowos.sh` to boot into Jow OS in under 1 second.
    - **`jwt_os_v4.iso`**: Bootable hybrid image for bare-metal testing
    (non-destructive RAMDisk mode).

